{"current_page":1,"data":[{"id":10161,"name":"Perkembangan PDB Sektor Pariwisata Tahun 2025","slug":"perkembangan-pdb-sektor-pariwisata-tahun-2025","description":"<p>Berdasarkan laporan Tourism Satellite Account (TSA) Indonesia 2023-2025 yang dipublikasikan oleh Badan Pusat Statistik, perkembangan Produk Domestik Bruto Sektor Pariwisata tahun 2025 tergambarkan sebagai berikut:<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Sektor pariwisata memberikan kontribusi langsung terhadap ekonomi nasional melalui Tourism Direct Gross Domestic Product (TDGDP) sebesar 4,78 persen atau tercatat sebesar&nbsp; Rp 1.138,90 triliun. Dari sisi permintaan, total Konsumsi Pariwisata Internal tercatat sebesar Rp2.408,97 triliun , yang terdiri dari pengeluaran wisatawan nusantara sebesar Rp2.090,31 triliun dan pengeluaran wisatawan mancanegara (inbound) sebesar Rp318,66 triliun.<\/p><p><br><\/p>","is_active":1,"is_draft":0,"created_at":"2026-09-01T07:59:41.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T08:07:24.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"create_by_id":37,"update_by_id":37,"delete_by_id":null,"category_id":26,"posted_by":"Biro Data dan Sistem Informasi","published_at":"2026-09-01 12:00:00","is_pinned":0,"is_preview_excel":0,"files":[{"id":16609,"disk_name":"6a96865a8c754965584848.pdf","file_name":"25. Perkembangan TSA.pdf","file_size":292442,"content_type":"application\/pdf","title":null,"description":null,"field":"files","sort_order":16609,"created_at":"2026-09-01T08:01:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T08:01:30.000000Z","path":"https:\/\/api.kemenpar.go.id\/storage\/app\/uploads\/public\/6a9\/686\/5a8\/6a96865a8c754965584848.pdf","extension":"pdf"}],"featured_image":{"id":16608,"disk_name":"6a9685ed4c956254159567.png","file_name":"25. Perkembangan TSA.png","file_size":320070,"content_type":"image\/png","title":null,"description":null,"field":"featured_image","sort_order":16608,"created_at":"2026-09-01T07:59:41.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T07:59:41.000000Z","path":"https:\/\/api.kemenpar.go.id\/storage\/app\/uploads\/